<title>POLAND: BWR FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 70,600 MLN.</title>
<headline>BWR FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 70,600 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit					  0.07 vs    0.76</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    0.21 vs    1.25</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  3.11 vs    3.16</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 8.52 vs    6.47</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit					  0.47 vs    1.01</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    0.62 vs    1.78</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  6.21 vs    5.42</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	16.76 vs   12.16</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Wspolpracy</p>
<p>Regionalnej SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
